activateAgentEnrolment.title.single      = You need to activate your agent service
activateAgentEnrolment.title.multiple    = You need to activate your agent services
activateAgentEnrolment.heading.single    = You need to activate your agent service
activateAgentEnrolment.heading.multiple  = You need to activate your agent services
activateAgentEnrolment.p1.single         = You must activate ‘{0}’ before you can ask a client for authorisation.
activateAgentEnrolment.p1.multiple       = You must activate at least one of these services before you can ask a client for authorisation:
activateAgentEnrolment.p2.single         = HMRC will send your activation code in the post, usually within 7 to 10 days of enrolment. Once you’ve received your code, you can activate the service.
activateAgentEnrolment.p2.multiple       = HMRC will send an activation code for each service in the post, usually within 7 to 10 days of enrolment. Once you’ve received your codes, you can activate the services.
activateAgentEnrolment.p3                = The code is valid for 28 days. If you don’t use it within that period, you must <a href="{0}" class="govuk-link">{1}</a> and enrol again.
activateAgentEnrolment.p3.linkText       = visit your business tax account

agentEnrolment.IR-SA-AGENT      = Self Assessment for agents
agentEnrolment.IR-CT-AGENT      = Corporation Tax for agents
agentEnrolment.IR-PAYE-AGENT    = PAYE for agents (including CIS and ERS)
agentEnrolment.HMCE-VAT-AGNT    = VAT for agents (including EU VAT refunds, NOVA and VAT MOSS)
agentEnrolment.HMRC-NOVRN-AGNT  = NOVA for agents (including EU VAT refunds and VAT MOSS)
agentEnrolment.HMRC-MGD-AGNT    = Machine Games Duty for agents
